
  PROFILES
  all    default    postgres, redis, mailpit, admin, api, web, migrate, seed
  admin             postgres, redis, api, admin
  api               postgres, redis, api
  web               postgres, redis, api, web

  JOBS
  postgres  service  docker compose up -d postgres        POSTGRES_PORT=5432  shared
  redis     service  docker compose up -d redis           REDIS_PORT=6379
  mailpit   service  docker compose up -d mailpit         MAILPIT_PORT=8025 MAILPIT_PORT_1025=1025  shared
  admin     service  pnpm exec next dev -p ${ADMIN_PORT}  ADMIN_PORT=3001 ↗
  api       service  pnpm dev                             PORT=4000 ↗
  web       service  pnpm dev                             PORT=3000 ↗
  migrate   task     pnpm migrate
  seed      task     pnpm seed

